The function is already a minimal bounds-checked load; I only add branch-prediction hints so the hot path (valid profile/index) stays fall-through, with no change in behaviour.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 Field::GetOffset() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].offset;
}
```